  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "Given:\n\n16 + [0.2 ÷ 0.004 + 5.2 of 2 ÷ (0.7 × 2 + 0.84 ÷ 0.7)]\n\nConcept used:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/c7a9b9173e89d44a854cc9c8053cf1e4425472078909d5687a2dfa61a2ec670c.png] \n\nCalculation:\n\n16 + [0.2 ÷ 0.004 + 5.2 of 2 ÷ (0.7 × 2 + 0.84 ÷ 0.7)]\n\n⇒ 16 + [0.2 ÷ 0.004 + 5.2 of 2 ÷ (1.4 + 1.2)]\n\n⇒ 16 + [0.2 ÷ 0.004 + 5.2 of 2 ÷ 2.6]\n\n⇒ 16 + [0.2 ÷ 0.004 + 10.4 ÷ 2.6]\n\n⇒ 16 + [0.2 ÷ 0.004 + 4]\n\n⇒ 16 + [50 + 4]\n\n⇒ 16 + 54\n\n⇒ 70\n\n**∴ The required answer is 70.**",
